# Context Workspace (locked)

**Canonical:** `docs/adr/022-context-workspace-first.md` · **Workstream:** `docs/adr/036-work-becomes-context.md` · **Commit densify:** `docs/adr/037-reality-commit-confirms-context.md`

## One sentence

> **Chat mutates the Workspace; Capsules live on the Globe; Commit roots Reality.**

> **Never ask users to create a context. Let their work become the context.** (ADR-036)

> **Reality Commit confirms the Context Graph** — Observation → Selection → Commit → Context Reality (ADR-037). Booking does not invent Context; Commit densifies it.

> **Confirmed Reality → never re-ask. Inferable → fill. Decision-needed → action propose, not slot quiz.**

Context · Session · Project IDs are engine bags. Users only work; `lib/workstream/` records residue (`HotelSelected` → `HotelCommitted`, …). Search does not persist history — selection / schedule / budget / Reality Commit do.

Context Workspace = Cursor IDE. Globe = Capsule 지도 + Forest (not the street editor).

## Cursor ↔ Rimvio

```
Context AI → 2D Workspace → Auto Save Snapshot → Globe Capsule → Resume | Reality Commit
(≈ Chat → IDE → Auto Save → Open recent → Git Commit)
```

## Core UX

```
Intent → Workspace → Auto Save Snapshot → Globe Capsule → Resume | Commit
```

- AI는 장문 답변이 아니라 **Workspace Patch**
- **Save 버튼 없음** — Snapshot = 함께 작업하던 순간의 상태
- Globe = **진행 중 AI 프로젝트 지도** (Capsule) + Commit 후 Forest
- Preview = 지도 티저만 · **펼치기**로만 full Workspace 오픈 (자동 펼침 금지)
- Capsule 탭 → Restore Workspace (“지난 작업 이어갈까요?”)
- Workspace 안에 **전용 프롬프트** (무엇이든 물어보세요)
- 📁 폴더 UI 금지 · 🌍 장소 앵커 Capsule만
- WHY = Action · Reason · Impact — on demand

## Preview → Open Workspace

```
Assistant Preview (chat embed)
  → 펼치기 → full 2D Workspace
```

User copy: **펼치기**. Internal: `workspace_preview` → `workspace_expand`.

## Map-needed work

`호텔 · 맛집 · POI · 편의` → Workspace-first → Snapshot Capsule / Commit Forest  
Scout stays; output = Patch only. No early lodging **search pins** on 3D.

## Maps

- Workspace 2D default = **MapLibre** (sharp street zoom)
- Optional Apple MapKit via env — not required
- **No 3D↔2D hybrid on Globe** — Workspace is a separate surface only

## Always One New Concept

한 화면에 Workspace + WHY + Agent + Draft + Forest를 동시에 가르치지 않는다.

## PR reject

- Search results only in assistant text  
- Lodging/eatery **search pins** on 3D before Commit (Capsule Snapshot ≠ pin stamp)  
- 📁 폴더 트리 as Globe UX · “파일 저장” as product verb  
- Manual Save as primary  
- Globe used as live street editor  
- Agent / Simulation as first-paint product nouns
